Package: bscode
Title: A Lightweight VS Code-Inspired Navigation Shell for bslib
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R: person(
    "Joshua", "Kunst",
    email = "56481+jbkunst@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Provides an opinionated, screen-filling page layout for Shiny
    applications. It reuses bslib navigation components while presenting them
    as either a compact activity bar or a wider icon-and-label sidebar on the
    left or right.
